Data sources incorporated in this repository carry their own licences:

- Eskom hourly system data (2025): Eskom Data Portal — public operational data
- UCT ESRG Single Node Hourly Demand Model (Bruno Merven, ZivaHub):
  https://doi.org/10.25375/uct.24137877 — CC BY 4.0
- PyPSA-RSA network topology and fleet data (Meridian Economics):
  https://github.com/MeridianEconomics/pypsa-rsa — MIT
- PVGIS SARAH2 solar profiles: European Commission JRC — open access
- Renewables.ninja wind profiles: Pfenninger & Staffell — CC BY-NC 4.0
- REIPPPP project data: DMRE / IPP Office — public domain
- GCCA connection capacity data: NTCSA — public domain

Users are responsible for complying with the terms of each upstream data source.
